            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Maybe use filter function, as in snacks.indent module?\n```lua\n-- filter for buffers to enable indent guides\nfilter = function(buf)\n    return vim.g.mini_indent ~= false and vim.b[buf].mini_indent ~= false and vim.bo[buf].buftype == \"\"\nend,\n```",
