        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nDisabling in buffer [can be done by setting `vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/855fdb116408085b7a00be8511c566cdc33648b7/doc/mini-indentscope.txt#L66-L72). See also [this recipe for automated disabling in a single buffer](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/855fdb116408085b7a00be8511c566cdc33648b7/doc/mini.txt#L345-L347).\n\nRelated to #1035, #535, #423, #167, #85, #52.",
